                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 8,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined Nevadans for the Common Good to talk about what I\u2019m doing to lower costs, protect health care, and defend the dignity of every family who calls Nevada home. I\u2019ll continue to work hard for the hardworking people of southern Nevada and make our community affordable and strong.",
