                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans in Washington have slashed bipartisan HIV-related funding \u2014 and innocent people are paying the price. On behalf of everyone living with HIV & AIDS and for the sake of the public's health, we must fight back.\n\n#WorldAIDSDay https://t.co/vc0LSYVWa6",
