                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 8,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I stood with Republicans and Democrats who are coming together and putting the American people above partisan politics to save health care. I have long said that I am willing to work with anyone to prevent health care costs from skyrocketing for millions of Americans this January.\n\nCommonGround 2025: A Bipartisan Health Care Framework is a plan that brings both sides together while making sure health care costs don\u2019t become unaffordable for families.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1764884508,
                "view_count": 718
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": [
                    "https://www.nytimes.com/2025/12/08/health/obamacare-deductibles-premiums-health-insurance.html"
