                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I have long said that if working people can\u2019t afford their health coverage, they will go without it. It is a risk families can\u2019t afford.\n\nCongress has the power to help these families. I\u2019ve put forward a plan with a bipartisan group of lawmakers to stop this health care crisis, but Republican leaders \u2014 who control the House, the Senate, and the White House \u2014 are failing to act fast enough. They would rather watch the ACA die and let families suffer than do the right thing \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/LLDc1UCrs0",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
