                "text": "For 12 years, Las Vegas Integrative Medicine has served thousands of veterans who have struggled with chronic pain, PTSD, and the lingering effects of trauma with alternatives to opioid-dependent pain management.\n\nIt was an honor to join Sanje Sedera and Dr. Yoojin Lee-Sedera at the launch of their new non-profit initiative, Integrative Health Alliance. We\u2019re thankful it will provide affordable or free integrative services for low-income families, especially veterans.",
